# Avoid

Do not extend these unless the user asks to migrate or delete them:

- Routes: `all-services`, `all-services-test`, `servicespage`, `services1test`, `admin/services-legacy/` (legacy UI)
- Stubs: dashboard, appointment, profile — wire existing components, do not fork new pages
- Tables: `categories`, `all_services`, `services_packages`, `other_services`, `tiered_services`, `detailingServices`, `services_all`
- Do not recreate `data/services.ts`

Do not:

- Add `middleware.ts`, Prisma, Drizzle, Redux, Zustand, or Tailwind v3 config
- Use `lib/supabase.ts` in new Server Components
- Hardcode catalog/hours that belong in Supabase
- Invent card layouts without updating `lib/app.types.ts` and public + admin renderers
- Use `any`, commit `.env*`, or log secrets
- Install with npm/yarn
- Bypass RLS with a service-role key in client or committed code
